 "nodes": [
  {
   "nodeID": "2_164572818278813617",
   "text": "we were not making comparisons",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "3_164572818278813617",
   "text": "George Eustice: We were not making comparisons",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "5_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Jordan: George Eustice: We were not making comparisons",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "7_164572818278813617",
   "text": "we have always tracked the death rates reported in all countries",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "8_164572818278813617",
   "text": "George Eustice: We have always tracked the death rates reported in all countries",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "10_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Jordan: George Eustice: We have always tracked the death rates reported in all countries",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "12_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "15_164572818278813617",
   "text": "we followed the advice of the chief medical officer and Chief Scientific Adviser all along",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "16_164572818278813617",
   "text": "George Eustice: We followed the advice of the chief medical officer and Chief Scientific Adviser all along",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "18_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Jordan: George Eustice: We followed the advice of the chief medical officer and Chief Scientific Adviser all along",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "21_164572818278813617",
   "text": "George Eustice: I think was correct",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "23_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Jordan: George Eustice: I think was correct",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "25_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "28_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "29_164572818278813617",
   "text": "we were roughly 2 to 3 weeks behind countries like Italy and France",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "30_164572818278813617",
   "text": "George Eustice: we were roughly 2 to 3 weeks behind countries like Italy and France",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "32_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Jordan: George Eustice: we were roughly 2 to 3 weeks behind countries like Italy and France",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "34_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "35_164572818278813617",
   "text": "we were on a different level",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "36_164572818278813617",
   "text": "George Eustice: We were on a different level",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "38_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Jordan: George Eustice: We were on a different level",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "40_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "48_164572818278813617",
   "text": "it was not appropriate to lockdown at the point Italy and France did",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "49_164572818278813617",
   "text": "George Eustice:  That's why it was not appropriate to lockdown at the point they did",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "51_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Jordan: George Eustice:  That's why it was not appropriate to lockdown at the point they did",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "56_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "58_164572818278813617",
   "text": "it is not true that we were not prepared",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "59_164572818278813617",
   "text": "George Eustice: It is not true that we were not prepared",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "61_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Jordan: George Eustice: It is not true that we were not prepared",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "63_164572818278813617",
   "text": "there were all sorts of planning meetings that were taking place on this right from January onwards",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "64_164572818278813617",
   "text": "George Eustice: There were all sorts of planning meetings that were taking place on this right from January onwards",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "66_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Jordan: George Eustice: There were all sorts of planning meetings that were taking place on this right from January onwards",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "68_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "71_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "73_164572818278813617",
   "text": "lockdown preparation meetings were occupying all of Matt Hancock's time",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "74_164572818278813617",
   "text": "George Eustice: It was occupying all of Matt Hancock's time",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "76_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Jordan: George Eustice: It was occupying all of Matt Hancock's time",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "79_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "81_164572818278813617",
   "text": "lots and lots of planning and preparation went into responding to a lockdown",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "82_164572818278813617",
   "text": "George Eustice: So lots and lots of planning and preparation went into responding to this",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "84_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Jordan: George Eustice: So lots and lots of planning and preparation went into responding to this",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "86_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "89_164572818278813617",
   "text": "the scientific advice was not that we should have locked down earlier than we did",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "90_164572818278813617",
   "text": "George Eustice: it was the case that the scientific advice was not that we should have locked down earlier than we did",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "92_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Jordan: George Eustice: it was the case that the scientific advice was not that we should have locked down earlier than we did",
   "type": "L"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "95_164572818278813617",
   "text": "Default Transition",
   "type": "TA"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "104_164572818278813617",
   "text": "as soon as the advice was we should lockdown, that's exactly what we did",
   "type": "I"
  },
  {
